      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This generously proportioned apartment is ideally located in the heart of Schull village, offering the convenience of village living with shops, cafés, bars the pier and foreshore all within easy walking distance.\r\nThe property has an attractive traditional stone-faced exterior and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The main living space is a particular feature, comprising a large open-plan kitchen, dining and living area.\r\nThe accommodation includes two bedrooms and a bathroom, with heating provided by a combination of the solid fuel stove and electric heating.\r\nThe apartment is in excellent condition throughout, while also offering a blank canvas for a new owner to add their own style and personal touches. Its central location makes it an appealing option as a permanent home, holiday base or investment property.\r\n\r\nProperty details: \r\nKitchen / dining / living: (6.2m x 5.7m) Solid fuel stove. \r\nBedroom 1: (3.9m x 3m) built in wardrobes \r\nBedroom 2: (3.9m x 3m) built in wardrobes \r\nBathroom: (2.3m x 2m) bath with electric shower unit, wc, whb \r\nUtility area with washing machine & dryer. \r\nStorage press \r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
